# What the hosted build does NOT need, and what happens without this file.
#
# The film pipeline put 887 MB under /video (a Remotion project with its own
# node_modules, the captures, the narration and the rendered masters) and the
# next `vercel deploy` died twice with "Upload aborted" and then "AbortError:
# The user aborted a request". Neither message mentions size, and the deploy
# script correctly refused to claim success, which is the only reason this was
# not a silent stale-bundle deploy.
#
# The research haul and the private working material are excluded for the same
# reason they are gitignored: they never leave this machine.
/video/
/research/
/private/
/data-legacy/
/reference/
/.gallery/
/.agents/
/captures/

# Local tooling and caches.
/scratch/
/playwright-report/
/test-results/
/blob-report/
.playwright-mcp/
